WEBVTT

01:14.480 --> 01:18.580
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.440 --> 01:23.880
[Episode 21]

01:27.956 --> 01:29.036
Huang.

01:29.906 --> 01:33.066
Please give the salaries
to the construction team.

01:37.836 --> 01:38.916
Mr. Xie,

01:39.516 --> 01:41.156
although I felt sorry,

01:41.596 --> 01:46.626
please help me to transfer this hotel.

01:47.786 --> 01:48.866
Okay.

01:49.146 --> 01:50.265
I'll do it.

01:50.266 --> 01:51.346
Don't worry.

01:52.876 --> 01:53.956
I...

01:55.346 --> 01:57.266
I don't know how to thank you.

01:58.396 --> 01:59.265
When I selected the site,

01:59.266 --> 02:00.876
you've been helping me.

02:01.836 --> 02:02.916
You helped me a lot,

02:03.426 --> 02:07.195
and I left such a mess to let you deal with.

02:07.196 --> 02:08.476
Don't say that.

02:08.706 --> 02:10.116
We just did what we can.

02:10.546 --> 02:12.396
I'm sorry we can't help you anymore.

02:14.866 --> 02:15.946
Hold on.

02:17.146 --> 02:18.396
It will be better.

02:21.636 --> 02:22.716
Thank you.

02:33.706 --> 02:34.826
Okay.

02:35.426 --> 02:37.266
Don't be so emotional.

02:37.636 --> 02:38.716
Just hold it.

02:39.426 --> 02:40.636
But I'm sad.

02:41.636 --> 02:43.146
I know you're sad.

02:43.706 --> 02:45.786
But it's not good crying back to the village.

02:47.076 --> 02:48.236
You're not sad?

02:49.636 --> 02:51.636
Of course, I am.

02:52.396 --> 02:56.266
I complained a few days ago.

02:57.466 --> 02:58.546
Me, too.

02:59.426 --> 03:00.506
I even scolded them.

03:01.116 --> 03:03.026
You're too mean, Xie Zhiyao.

03:03.796 --> 03:05.476
Do I also need to cry?

03:06.916 --> 03:07.865
No.

03:07.866 --> 03:08.986
You need to drive.

03:19.116 --> 03:21.076
They are so bad.

03:22.266 --> 03:23.865
Huang is an official here,

03:23.866 --> 03:25.795
so she should help them.

03:25.796 --> 03:27.355
But it's none of your business.

03:27.356 --> 03:29.235
You've been helping them,

03:29.236 --> 03:30.636
but they blamed you.

03:32.026 --> 03:33.516
Wait, Hu...

03:34.266 --> 03:35.515
Just stop.

03:35.516 --> 03:37.465
Let me tell you what he will do next.

03:37.466 --> 03:40.025
He'll ask you to transfer the hotel.

03:40.026 --> 03:41.075
After that,

03:41.076 --> 03:43.676
they'll give the renovation costs
to the construction team.

03:44.026 --> 03:46.075
You're in charge of it.

03:46.076 --> 03:49.115
They're sure you can't leave them like that.

03:49.116 --> 03:50.915
Hu, don't just blame them.

03:50.916 --> 03:51.516
Just let me tell...

03:51.517 --> 03:52.395
What is wrong with you?

03:52.396 --> 03:54.076
Why couldn't I blame them?

03:54.586 --> 03:55.796
You're mad.

03:56.916 --> 03:58.396
His wife has cancer.

04:05.836 --> 04:10.395
They resigned from their jobs in Shenzhen
and decided to open a homestay hotel here.

04:10.396 --> 04:12.386
They thought they would live here.

04:13.146 --> 04:14.585
At the beginning of the year,

04:14.586 --> 04:16.405
his wife's legs felt painful.

04:16.406 --> 04:17.701
They thought it was a calcium deficiency.

04:17.702 --> 04:19.130
When they went to the hospital,

04:19.154 --> 04:20.794
the doctor said it is bone cancer.

04:21.266 --> 04:22.546
And it's in the mid-term.

04:23.556 --> 04:25.145
After they discussed it,

04:25.146 --> 04:26.226
they thought,

04:26.266 --> 04:27.875
the money is needed here,

04:27.876 --> 04:29.516
and they don't want to trouble us.

04:29.636 --> 04:32.225
Then they decided to continue
building the homestay hotel,

04:32.226 --> 04:34.626
and receive treatment in Shenzhen.

04:36.226 --> 04:37.306
However,

04:37.876 --> 04:39.986
their family knew about it.

04:40.666 --> 04:41.746
They were worried.

04:41.816 --> 04:44.496
His father had cerebral infarction,
and is living in ICU now.

04:44.636 --> 04:47.506
The money was spent quickly every day.

04:48.516 --> 04:50.116
They really met trouble.

04:51.396 --> 04:52.476
Well,

04:52.586 --> 04:54.426
misfortunes never come singly.

04:56.556 --> 04:58.116
Why didn't you tell me early?

04:59.076 --> 05:01.265
Before Mr. Xie said anything,

05:01.266 --> 05:02.586
you started to blame them.

05:03.226 --> 05:05.666
Mr. Xie wanted to interrupt you,
but you didn't listen.

05:06.026 --> 05:07.236
Well done.

05:10.226 --> 05:11.386
Let's go.

05:14.466 --> 05:18.716
Well, do you think we need to donate some money?

05:22.026 --> 05:23.106
Spray it again?

05:31.346 --> 05:32.796
Damai, what are you doing?

05:35.196 --> 05:36.635
I have blisters on my feet.

05:36.636 --> 05:38.755
Two on each feet
and it's symmetric.

05:38.756 --> 05:39.836
See?

05:42.106 --> 05:43.676
Do we need to go tomorrow?

05:45.996 --> 05:47.195
No.

05:47.196 --> 05:49.665
Xie Zhiyao said Yang Guanjun will go there.

05:49.666 --> 05:50.836
We don't need to go.

05:52.436 --> 05:54.555
Hu and I told Auntie Feng,

05:54.556 --> 05:55.916
we'll go there late.

05:57.076 --> 05:59.145
Because the lunch tomorrow is,

05:59.146 --> 06:00.226
roast pork.

06:00.786 --> 06:02.146
You won't update the novel?

06:02.396 --> 06:04.585
I'll write the novel
after putting the plaster on.

06:04.586 --> 06:06.345
If you have no idea today,

06:06.346 --> 06:07.666
you can't update tomorrow.

06:07.836 --> 06:09.356
Don't worry, I've written more,

06:09.836 --> 06:13.276
for two days to update.

06:14.346 --> 06:16.755
Two days? That's quite enough.

06:16.756 --> 06:18.145
Two days?

06:18.146 --> 06:21.626
That's not enough to write the unit event
of investigating the water source.

06:26.346 --> 06:27.345
Don't try to hide it.

06:27.346 --> 06:28.426
I've noticed it.

06:30.516 --> 06:31.626
Do you?

06:32.226 --> 06:35.465
Nana will use three accounts to comment.

06:35.466 --> 06:36.546
And Hongdou has two.

06:37.956 --> 06:39.916
How did you know that?

06:40.266 --> 06:41.345
It's simple.

06:41.346 --> 06:45.025
Because these accounts
were registered at almost the same time,

06:45.026 --> 06:47.716
and only commented on my novel.

06:49.226 --> 06:51.905
Then how did you distinguish us?

06:51.906 --> 06:54.236
By pet phrases and typing style.

06:54.906 --> 06:56.145
When Nana sends messages,

06:56.146 --> 06:59.546
she likes to use a wave sign and smile.

06:59.996 --> 07:03.986
And her three accounts
are mainly used to blame those haters.

07:04.346 --> 07:05.265
But I read her comments,

07:05.266 --> 07:06.346
it's like,

07:06.706 --> 07:08.755
your parents raised you,

07:08.756 --> 07:11.066
do they want you to be an Internet troll here?

07:12.026 --> 07:13.465
You're so mean.

07:13.466 --> 07:15.476
You are the rubbish on the Internet,

07:15.906 --> 07:16.666
and so on.

07:16.667 --> 07:17.955
Although she commented a lot,

07:17.956 --> 07:20.236
what she said is not aggressive at all.

07:20.906 --> 07:23.626
The comments Hongdou wrote are like poems.

07:24.076 --> 07:26.426
It feels ethereal,

07:27.516 --> 07:29.555
and makes people think she is capable.

07:29.556 --> 07:30.635
But you're not sure,

07:30.636 --> 07:32.476
which point she praises.

07:33.076 --> 07:34.156
For example,

07:35.906 --> 07:37.386
in the writer's novel,

07:37.706 --> 07:39.635
time is like a desert,

07:39.636 --> 07:40.796
making people drained.

07:42.516 --> 07:44.225
What's the key point of praising people?

07:44.226 --> 07:46.635
That is to be straightforward, strong,

07:46.636 --> 07:48.635
direct and praise as much as you can.

07:48.636 --> 07:50.465
You should let the writer feel the power,

07:50.466 --> 07:51.905
and let her feel sorry for you

07:51.906 --> 07:53.986
if she didn't write 20,000 words.

07:59.106 --> 08:00.836
I'm just kidding.

08:02.106 --> 08:03.395
I didn't praise like that.

08:03.396 --> 08:05.156
I just saw people praise like that.

08:05.836 --> 08:07.145
I just blamed those haters.

08:07.146 --> 08:08.426
I didn't write others.

08:10.026 --> 08:11.106
It's you.

08:15.706 --> 08:16.786
What's wrong?

08:17.146 --> 08:19.195
All we did was in vain.

08:19.196 --> 08:20.986
You knew it was us.

08:24.666 --> 08:25.836
Actually,

08:27.106 --> 08:28.986
although I knew it was you,

08:30.276 --> 08:34.146
when I saw those encouraging comments,

08:34.676 --> 08:36.836
and felt your care and love,

08:37.626 --> 08:40.986
my heart was filled with courage and power.

08:42.156 --> 08:44.236
And I've decided.

08:44.640 --> 08:45.425
I won't look for a job.

08:45.426 --> 08:46.795
I'll continue writing novels.

08:46.796 --> 08:48.275
Really?

08:48.276 --> 08:48.866
Yes.

08:48.867 --> 08:51.147
I've started to write
the outline of my next novel.

08:53.106 --> 08:54.035
So,

08:54.036 --> 08:55.345
Barley Tea,

08:55.346 --> 08:56.746
you won't stop writing?

08:57.916 --> 08:58.835
I won't.

08:58.836 --> 08:59.916
I'll continue.

09:01.196 --> 09:04.506
We've been trapped in others' comments,

09:04.746 --> 09:06.626
but we need to understand one thing.

09:07.386 --> 09:09.476
When the flood comes to you,

09:11.106 --> 09:12.236
you are drowned,

09:12.746 --> 09:14.026
but it's not your fault.

09:21.796 --> 09:22.876
That's right.

09:28.241 --> 09:28.955
Where is my phone?

09:28.956 --> 09:30.275
You didn't bring it here.

09:30.276 --> 09:31.356
I didn't?

09:31.916 --> 09:33.865
What I said just now is an aphorism.

09:33.866 --> 09:35.105
An aphorism, you know?

09:35.106 --> 09:38.505
That is the theme of the unit
of water source investigation.

09:38.506 --> 09:40.795
I know what to write, dear sisters!

09:40.796 --> 09:42.116
I'll go back and write.

09:44.156 --> 09:45.236
Be careful.

09:46.556 --> 09:47.836
Great!

09:51.466 --> 09:53.585
♫ I've been longing, ♫

09:53.586 --> 09:55.836
♫ to realize my dream. ♫

09:56.746 --> 09:58.626
♫ The more you want it, ♫

09:59.036 --> 10:01.556
♫ the more clumsy you are. ♫

10:01.956 --> 10:04.076
♫ Your confusion, ♫

10:04.346 --> 10:06.026
♫ my panic, ♫

10:07.346 --> 10:10.626
♫ it is watching us, ♫

10:13.506 --> 10:15.476
♫ but it said nothing. ♫

10:22.866 --> 10:24.476
Dou said,

10:25.106 --> 10:27.585
she picked the plums herself.

10:27.586 --> 10:30.066
Then she packed them
in the orchard and sent them to me.

10:30.346 --> 10:32.346
It's much cheaper than those in the market.

10:33.346 --> 10:34.105
That's right.

10:34.106 --> 10:35.956
It's also helping the orchard workers.

10:37.916 --> 10:39.585
Guisheng, drive here.

10:39.586 --> 10:41.066
I'll pack two boxes for Kexin.

10:42.106 --> 10:43.786
There are plenty of plums.

10:51.346 --> 10:52.866
I sent twenty boxes for you.

10:53.386 --> 10:55.386
It's not too much, just about 50 kilograms.

10:56.106 --> 10:57.986
You can make them into jam.

10:58.626 --> 10:59.625
It's not expensive.

10:59.626 --> 11:01.116
The fruits are cheap here.

11:04.796 --> 11:05.876
Okay.

11:06.226 --> 11:07.666
Make delicious food for me?

11:09.226 --> 11:11.076
Just wash the plums first.

11:11.506 --> 11:12.626
Okay, bye-bye.

11:13.136 --> 11:14.345
[Nanxing's mom]

11:14.346 --> 11:16.626
[Sister]

11:20.586 --> 11:21.666
Hello.

11:23.106 --> 11:24.035
You received it?

11:24.036 --> 11:29.116
You want me to sell plums
at the metro entrance by sending me so many?

11:29.436 --> 11:30.516
It's not too much.

11:30.746 --> 11:32.386
You can give them to your friends,

11:32.706 --> 11:34.196
to some relatives,

11:34.436 --> 11:35.906
and Lingdang's teachers.

11:36.556 --> 11:38.356
How's your vacation?

11:38.796 --> 11:39.795
Good.

11:39.796 --> 11:41.866
It's comfortable to stay here.

11:43.626 --> 11:44.986
Really?

11:49.386 --> 11:51.626
Are you hiding anything from me?

11:53.226 --> 11:54.306
What?

11:54.796 --> 11:56.786
But I feel there is something.

11:58.226 --> 12:00.266
Fine, just try to feel it.

12:01.226 --> 12:02.306
Okay, bye-bye.

12:04.436 --> 12:05.516
How's it?

12:05.676 --> 12:06.876
Did you get the result?

12:08.986 --> 12:12.196
Sister Hongdou, can I quit math?

12:13.586 --> 12:14.666
Of course not.

12:14.986 --> 12:17.666
But I don't like math.

12:18.626 --> 12:19.706
Why is that?

12:23.276 --> 12:24.356
Eight plus nine.

12:24.626 --> 12:26.195
Eight plus nine.

12:26.196 --> 12:28.746
You can't figure out the result in 20 minutes?

12:28.986 --> 12:30.865
Mom, don't talk so loudly.

12:30.866 --> 12:32.155
I can hear you.

12:32.156 --> 12:33.155
You can hear me?

12:33.156 --> 12:34.105
Then do it again.

12:34.106 --> 12:35.186
Come on.

12:35.466 --> 12:36.546
Count.

12:37.346 --> 12:38.435
One.

12:38.436 --> 12:39.516
Two.

12:39.676 --> 12:40.756
Three.

12:41.346 --> 12:42.426
Four.

12:42.626 --> 12:43.706
Five.

12:45.626 --> 12:46.706
Six.

12:47.036 --> 12:48.266
Seven.

12:49.036 --> 12:50.116
Eight.

12:50.346 --> 12:51.426
Nine.

12:51.706 --> 12:52.786
Ten.

12:53.556 --> 12:55.026
Eleven.

12:55.706 --> 12:57.155
Twelve.

12:57.156 --> 12:57.866
Thirteen.

12:57.866 --> 12:58.946
Okay, stop.

12:59.466 --> 13:00.322
There.

13:00.346 --> 13:01.795
There is a finger, right?

13:01.796 --> 13:04.356
Is my finger too short that you can't see it?

13:05.466 --> 13:07.075
Mom, I saw it.

13:07.076 --> 13:08.505
Don't be angry.

13:08.506 --> 13:10.075
I'm not angry.

13:10.076 --> 13:11.675
You can't figure out such a simple question.

13:11.676 --> 13:13.386
What can you do in the future?

13:15.346 --> 13:17.196
Don't look at me like that.

13:21.076 --> 13:21.676
Just continue.

13:21.677 --> 13:23.675
We'll stop when you can figure it out.

13:23.676 --> 13:24.756
Do it!

13:34.626 --> 13:35.706
Overcome difficulty.

13:39.956 --> 13:42.116
Just help me this time.

13:42.676 --> 13:44.236
Please.

13:59.386 --> 14:00.466
Only this time.

14:14.796 --> 14:15.745
Do it again,

14:15.746 --> 14:16.826
understand?

15:02.464 --> 15:06.123
♫ I've been alone ♫

15:06.124 --> 15:09.605
♫ Into the unknown ♫

15:09.606 --> 15:16.892
♫ Can I get a guide through the dark ♫

15:16.893 --> 15:20.405
♫ I'm searching for ♫

15:20.406 --> 15:23.949
♫ a meadow of mine ♫

15:23.950 --> 15:30.996
♫ Till you came in with the breeze ♫

15:33.626 --> 15:35.666
Why are there so many annoying things?

15:36.226 --> 15:37.956
Nothing went on well.

15:40.916 --> 15:42.716
How do you want to transfer the hotel?

15:42.956 --> 15:44.076
It's not cheap.

15:44.706 --> 15:45.786
Who will buy it?

15:48.156 --> 15:51.266
If there is a Shaohua Bookstore in the village,

15:51.866 --> 15:54.146
I can transfer the hotel to whomever I want.

15:57.196 --> 15:59.316
What if they won't invest in a bookstore here?

16:01.796 --> 16:03.356
Then I'll run the hotel myself.

16:03.986 --> 16:05.076
Do you have money?

16:09.506 --> 16:10.586
No.

16:10.626 --> 16:11.906
Then how can you run it?

16:13.196 --> 16:14.836
I'll go out to make money.

16:16.836 --> 16:18.556
Just listen to what you said.

16:19.106 --> 16:20.836
It seems money is like mushrooms,

16:21.076 --> 16:22.705
it will grow after rain,

16:22.706 --> 16:24.746
then you can make as much money as you want.

16:30.866 --> 16:33.236
Why didn't I study hard back then?

16:33.796 --> 16:35.275
If I went to college,

16:35.276 --> 16:36.716
I could help you now.

16:38.956 --> 16:42.745
You stayed here and opened a barbecue stand.

16:42.746 --> 16:43.969
When I am hungry,

16:43.970 --> 16:46.050
I don't need to go far to eat delicious food.

16:46.986 --> 16:49.026
You can drink with me sometimes,

16:49.796 --> 16:51.345
and listen to me,

16:51.346 --> 16:52.956
this is helping me.

16:59.866 --> 17:00.946
You're right.

17:01.276 --> 17:02.596
People are relying on you.

17:03.586 --> 17:04.836
Who can you rely on?

17:05.716 --> 17:07.276
You have heavy pressure.

17:09.236 --> 17:11.316
Everyone has pressure.

17:13.716 --> 17:14.836
It's no big deal.

17:18.146 --> 17:18.865
Okay,

17:18.866 --> 17:19.945
come down.

17:19.946 --> 17:21.026
Be careful.

17:28.426 --> 17:29.946
Xu Hongdou ordered a takeout.

17:30.386 --> 17:31.836
You can bring it to her.

17:34.186 --> 17:35.266
What did she order?

17:35.720 --> 17:36.800
I won't tell you.

17:37.076 --> 17:38.105
She likes shrimp.

17:38.106 --> 17:39.105
Take this.

17:39.106 --> 17:40.556
She ordered that.

17:41.556 --> 17:42.515
The eggplant.

17:42.516 --> 17:43.532
A big one.

17:43.556 --> 17:44.666
Can you shut up?

17:45.556 --> 17:46.636
The vegetables.

17:51.666 --> 17:53.475
Watch the fire when you're barbecuing.

17:53.476 --> 17:54.035
Less oil...

17:54.036 --> 17:55.116
You can do that.

17:56.946 --> 17:58.186
Just hurry up.

18:14.476 --> 18:16.426
Why are you standing outside the yard?

18:17.186 --> 18:19.475
Yang Guanjun told me you drank wine.

18:19.476 --> 18:20.755
I'm afraid you'll sleep in the alley,

18:20.756 --> 18:22.116
so I'm here to pick you up.

18:23.276 --> 18:24.636
You didn't have supper yet?

18:24.906 --> 18:25.755
I did.

18:25.756 --> 18:27.866
I ordered for Damai and Hu.

18:32.236 --> 18:33.706
You drank a lot of wine.

18:35.756 --> 18:36.836
Not too much.

18:37.756 --> 18:39.235
Do you have wine?

18:39.236 --> 18:40.796
How about drinking some with me?

18:43.666 --> 18:44.492
Okay.

18:44.516 --> 18:45.596
Let's go.

19:03.276 --> 19:04.356
Your wine.

19:11.996 --> 19:13.076
Milk?

19:14.346 --> 19:16.275
You drank a lot tonight.

19:16.276 --> 19:17.555
When granny sees you,

19:17.556 --> 19:18.995
she'll worry about you.

19:18.996 --> 19:20.076
Drink some milk.

19:25.666 --> 19:26.796
You added sugar?

19:27.076 --> 19:28.156
It's honey.

19:36.996 --> 19:38.146
Are you okay?

19:41.276 --> 19:42.706
I'm fine if you don't ask.

19:44.186 --> 19:44.836
When you asked me,

19:44.837 --> 19:46.386
I feel a little upset.

19:52.346 --> 19:53.626
Well,

19:55.036 --> 19:58.276
it's hard to say.

20:07.476 --> 20:09.186
After meeting Li that day,

20:10.476 --> 20:12.316
the boss of the homestay hotel,

20:14.186 --> 20:16.556
I felt a little upset.

20:19.186 --> 20:20.266
I can understand.

20:23.236 --> 20:25.666
And I often met his wife.

20:26.906 --> 20:29.306
She would treat us to a meal
every time we went there.

20:31.236 --> 20:32.316
She said,

20:33.076 --> 20:34.836
after the homestay hotel was built,

20:35.666 --> 20:38.026
she'll invite her parents
to come here to enjoy life.

20:38.836 --> 20:41.836
Although her kid is only two years old,

20:42.756 --> 20:45.706
he can go to kindergarten in the town.

20:46.996 --> 20:48.676
Even if they can't make much money,

20:49.866 --> 20:51.556
the price is cheap here.

20:52.556 --> 20:54.706
It can support the whole family.

20:57.796 --> 20:58.876
But,

20:59.076 --> 21:00.756
she is such a good person,

21:01.586 --> 21:02.625
and so young.

21:02.626 --> 21:04.116
Her kid is so little.

21:04.426 --> 21:05.946
She still has a long way to go.

21:06.796 --> 21:08.996
Why did she suddenly have cancer?

21:15.346 --> 21:17.386
My mom told me,

21:18.946 --> 21:21.026
there is no old or young on the way to death.

21:23.346 --> 21:24.625
You never know

21:24.626 --> 21:31.906
when and how a person leaves the world.

21:36.796 --> 21:37.946
So,

21:39.906 --> 21:41.146
when I think of this,

21:41.906 --> 21:43.316
I feel,

21:45.106 --> 21:46.186
a little afraid.

21:47.346 --> 21:48.426
Afraid?

21:52.516 --> 21:53.626
Well,

21:55.996 --> 21:58.426
many people are relying on me now.

22:00.036 --> 22:01.946
If I have a serious illness,

22:02.386 --> 22:04.105
or have an accident,

22:04.106 --> 22:05.626
and I suddenly died,

22:05.996 --> 22:07.996
and leave such a mess for them,

22:08.556 --> 22:09.946
what can they do?

22:11.996 --> 22:12.796
When I think of this,

22:12.796 --> 22:13.876
I feel,

22:14.236 --> 22:16.466
I feel a little upset.

22:17.476 --> 22:19.756
Fear, anxiety, scare,

22:19.996 --> 22:21.385
and a sense of insecurity,

22:21.386 --> 22:22.626
they surround me.

22:28.586 --> 22:31.226
Do you think I thought too much?

22:34.346 --> 22:35.426
I understand.

22:38.556 --> 22:40.036
As a man,

22:40.476 --> 22:41.946
I'm so sensitive.

22:42.906 --> 22:44.235
Just ignore me.

22:44.236 --> 22:45.316
Ignore me.

22:46.996 --> 22:48.116
I can understand you.

22:53.076 --> 22:55.036
I totally understand you.

22:58.386 --> 22:59.466
Trust me.

23:06.756 --> 23:10.626
It's like missing a step.

23:12.836 --> 23:13.916
That,

23:14.796 --> 23:15.876
anxiety,

23:16.236 --> 23:17.316
fear,

23:18.946 --> 23:23.906
uncertainty of future life,

23:25.076 --> 23:26.476
without a sense of security.

23:26.906 --> 23:28.706
It's like,

23:28.996 --> 23:30.146
in the desert,

23:30.716 --> 23:31.836
when you look around,

23:32.586 --> 23:33.756
there is nothing,

23:35.146 --> 23:36.796
and you don't know where to go.

23:47.556 --> 23:51.556
I thought you can't understand such a feeling.

24:00.626 --> 24:01.706
Let's go to my room.

24:02.946 --> 24:04.026
Can you walk?

24:06.036 --> 24:07.275
I can,

24:07.276 --> 24:09.466
but is it too late now?

24:09.836 --> 24:11.556
I want to show you something.

24:41.716 --> 24:43.906
Close the door. Don't let the mosquitos in.

24:59.516 --> 25:02.866
I want to share with you the story of my love.

25:06.106 --> 25:07.866
You didn't let me see this,

25:08.186 --> 25:09.626
why do you let me see it now?

25:09.996 --> 25:11.946
I was not prepared before.

25:16.516 --> 25:19.335
[Making friends]

25:19.336 --> 25:21.616
[Today's Xie Zhiyao]

25:23.426 --> 25:26.105
Xie Zhiyao, not too bad.

25:26.106 --> 25:28.425
I'm just a not-too-bad person?

25:28.426 --> 25:30.226
I was just starting to write it.

25:35.586 --> 25:37.116
Why are you writing these?

25:54.186 --> 25:55.266
It's for her.

25:56.756 --> 25:57.836
Who is it?

26:00.666 --> 26:01.746
Chen Nanxing.

26:03.946 --> 26:05.356
Chen Nanxing is a girl?

26:06.076 --> 26:07.996
It's not your ex-boyfriend?

26:08.906 --> 26:10.626
She is the love of my life,

26:12.516 --> 26:13.706
my best friend,

26:15.276 --> 26:16.516
and will always be.

26:19.476 --> 26:21.105
She is busy working,

26:21.106 --> 26:22.796
so you wrote this for her?

26:23.346 --> 26:24.426
She died,

26:24.836 --> 26:25.916
because of cancer.

26:37.106 --> 26:39.316
I can understand what you said.

26:39.836 --> 26:42.036
And I might have
a deeper understanding than you.

26:46.626 --> 26:48.226
The peer around you,

26:48.796 --> 26:50.516
the one who has been companying you,

26:51.036 --> 26:53.666
suddenly encountered a huge misfortune.

26:53.946 --> 26:55.756
Our hearts will shake with that.

26:59.346 --> 27:01.186
It's like being trapped in a nightmare.

27:02.626 --> 27:05.186
It's like missing a step on the high ladder.

27:07.106 --> 27:09.146
It's like a plane missing in radar.

27:11.626 --> 27:13.836
It's like missing the direction in the desert.

27:14.906 --> 27:17.945
It's like a polar bear sitting on melting ice,

27:17.946 --> 27:19.706
and can't find the direction.

27:26.516 --> 27:28.345
I can't tell people

27:28.346 --> 27:30.426
my fear, anxiety,

27:30.836 --> 27:32.226
and the doubt in life.

27:34.556 --> 27:36.076
What am I?

27:39.556 --> 27:41.356
Even my best friend,

27:42.996 --> 27:48.556
her death made no difference to my life.

27:50.426 --> 27:52.386
I'll go to work, go home,

27:53.255 --> 27:54.695
go shopping and watch movies.

27:56.516 --> 27:59.466
I would miss her when I was alone and sad.

28:00.604 --> 28:04.425
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

28:04.426 --> 28:06.756
Her parents lost everything when she died.

28:08.716 --> 28:09.796
I think...

28:10.186 --> 28:11.266
I think I...

28:12.716 --> 28:16.276
I'm not qualified to be sad
for a long time when I lost her.

28:22.666 --> 28:23.746
Xu Hongdou.

28:27.146 --> 28:30.146
The moral standard
you set for yourself is too strict.

28:32.866 --> 28:35.466
Even feeling painful
and how long you'll be painful,

28:37.996 --> 28:39.316
you should be qualified?

28:44.626 --> 28:45.706
Maybe.

28:50.146 --> 28:51.795
Nanxing said,

28:51.796 --> 28:54.186
she wanted to come to Yunnan with me.

28:56.346 --> 28:57.626
But at that time,

28:58.946 --> 29:01.316
I don't want to delay my work.

29:02.146 --> 29:03.506
I want to have a promotion.

29:08.146 --> 29:09.386
Now here I am.

29:11.946 --> 29:12.835
But see?

29:12.836 --> 29:14.146
She is not here.

29:14.375 --> 29:16.115
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

29:16.116 --> 29:20.516
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

29:20.954 --> 29:26.956
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

29:37.367 --> 29:43.768
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

29:43.769 --> 29:49.716
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

29:53.146 --> 29:53.989
I'm fine.

29:53.990 --> 29:58.116
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

29:58.609 --> 30:04.476
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

30:05.880 --> 30:13.116
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

30:45.716 --> 30:48.715
[Thank you for listening to Nanxing's story.]

30:48.716 --> 30:51.715
[I feel happy to tell you this story.]

30:51.716 --> 30:54.996
[Just take it as our secret, thank you.]

31:00.336 --> 31:03.436
[I'm also happy. Sleep early, good night.]

31:05.106 --> 31:07.626
Why did I say nothing at crucial moments?

31:08.426 --> 31:09.796
I can't even comfort her.

31:11.626 --> 31:12.706
So silly.

31:26.666 --> 31:28.995
Barbecued meat sandwich.

31:28.996 --> 31:30.076
Have a try.

31:41.996 --> 31:43.076
How's it?

31:44.386 --> 31:45.466
Not good.

31:49.186 --> 31:50.426
The meat is too greasy,

31:51.346 --> 31:52.516
and it's too sweet.

31:52.906 --> 31:53.986
Strange taste.

31:55.866 --> 31:56.946
And advantages?

32:00.866 --> 32:03.036
The bread is soft and delicious.

32:06.716 --> 32:09.756
It seems I should put less chocolate jam.

32:10.076 --> 32:13.116
And the meat should be more scorched.

32:15.996 --> 32:17.418
Come here tomorrow morning.

32:17.419 --> 32:18.499
Let's continue.

32:19.666 --> 32:20.796
Again?

32:21.146 --> 32:22.906
Just take it as breakfast.

32:23.236 --> 32:24.626
Don't waste it.

32:25.236 --> 32:26.345
I won't come tomorrow.

32:26.346 --> 32:27.426
I'll eat at home.

32:27.946 --> 32:29.746
It seems you also said that yesterday.

32:32.946 --> 32:34.026
Hi.

32:34.386 --> 32:35.466
Mr. Xie.

32:35.666 --> 32:36.276
Hello, my brother.

32:36.276 --> 32:36.755
Morning.

32:36.756 --> 32:38.235
- You're also here, Xiaxia.
- Morning.

32:38.236 --> 32:39.386
I am being poisoned.

32:39.756 --> 32:41.626
He is trying new dishes for me.

32:46.516 --> 32:47.596
Good morning.

32:47.666 --> 32:48.746
Morning.

32:49.516 --> 32:50.596
Coffee?

32:51.146 --> 32:52.426
I drank it at home.

32:53.276 --> 32:54.356
Okay.

32:56.076 --> 32:57.316
I'll show you something.

32:57.756 --> 32:58.836
What is it?

32:59.146 --> 33:00.442
The promotional video.

33:00.443 --> 33:02.043
Sunzi sent it to me this morning.

33:02.586 --> 33:03.666
So quick?

33:08.386 --> 33:09.466
Are you ready?

33:11.836 --> 33:16.916
[Come to a windy place]

33:24.476 --> 33:25.276
Where is this place?

33:25.277 --> 33:26.666
It's so beautiful.

33:27.866 --> 33:28.946
There is Xinxin.

33:29.146 --> 33:30.905
It's more than that.

33:30.906 --> 33:33.076
Huang is the leading actress in it, okay?

33:35.357 --> 33:40.436
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

33:42.747 --> 33:49.187
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

33:49.188 --> 33:54.516
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

33:58.106 --> 33:59.186
Qin.

34:04.466 --> 34:05.675
There are your mom and Auntie Gui.

34:05.676 --> 34:09.756
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

34:12.278 --> 34:18.516
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

34:18.770 --> 34:25.116
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

34:27.093 --> 34:33.236
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

34:33.532 --> 34:36.675
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

34:36.676 --> 34:37.425
Nana.

34:37.426 --> 34:38.916
Your hands are good at acting.

34:41.806 --> 34:43.675
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

34:43.676 --> 34:47.676
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

34:48.302 --> 34:54.116
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

34:56.756 --> 34:57.835
Wow, amazing.

34:57.836 --> 34:59.235
Be together.

34:59.236 --> 35:00.316
Get married now.

35:01.636 --> 35:03.235
My brother, I'll be your groomsman.

35:03.236 --> 35:04.345
Sister-in-law, well,

35:04.346 --> 35:05.945
Hongdou.

35:05.946 --> 35:07.505
Enough, will you watch it or not?

35:07.506 --> 35:07.756
Yes.

35:07.757 --> 35:12.636
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

35:15.273 --> 35:16.353
It's beautiful.

35:16.796 --> 35:18.116
Where is this place?

35:19.346 --> 35:21.425
There is no video effect in it, right?

35:21.426 --> 35:22.626
It's the real galaxy.

35:22.866 --> 35:23.795
Yes.

35:23.796 --> 35:25.275
My brother took me there the year before last.

35:25.276 --> 35:26.425
We drove the jeep there.

35:26.426 --> 35:27.675
There are so many stars,

35:27.676 --> 35:28.756
it's bright.

35:29.866 --> 35:30.956
I want to go there.

35:32.946 --> 35:34.595
I knew you want to go there.

35:34.596 --> 35:35.385
So,

35:35.386 --> 35:37.506
I'm organizing a team-building activity again.

35:37.946 --> 35:39.755
Again?

35:39.756 --> 35:42.465
Which place needs free labor this time?

35:42.466 --> 35:44.155
This time is real.

35:44.156 --> 35:45.795
You were tired of picking the plums,

35:45.796 --> 35:48.357
so I'll organize a camp at night
and play for a whole day.

35:49.156 --> 35:50.236
Can I go with you?

35:50.622 --> 35:51.835
I also worked for two days.

35:51.836 --> 35:52.916
You can go with us.

35:54.236 --> 35:55.595
Will you go and play with us?

35:55.596 --> 35:56.595
That place is beautiful.

35:56.596 --> 35:58.036
You can take pretty pictures.

35:59.946 --> 36:01.026
When will you go?

36:02.596 --> 36:03.676
Tomorrow afternoon.

36:03.756 --> 36:05.755
We'll camp out for one night
and come back the next day.

36:05.756 --> 36:06.795
It won't bother work.

36:06.796 --> 36:07.385
Okay.

36:07.386 --> 36:09.715
I'll ask who wants to go with us in the group.

36:09.716 --> 36:10.465
Okay.

36:10.466 --> 36:10.835
Good.

36:10.836 --> 36:12.276
I'll prepare the rest things.

36:12.636 --> 36:13.716
Dismiss.

36:13.967 --> 36:16.018
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

36:16.019 --> 36:20.276
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

36:20.613 --> 36:26.636
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

36:27.596 --> 36:29.266
It's so quiet and comfortable.

36:30.156 --> 36:32.626
It feels like there are only us in the world.

36:33.506 --> 36:34.586
You're right.

36:35.466 --> 36:38.436
I have some inspirations for my new books.

36:39.026 --> 36:40.235
Enough, Damai.

36:40.236 --> 36:41.235
Enough.

36:41.236 --> 36:42.956
Just finish the ending first.

36:43.756 --> 36:44.836
Okay.

36:47.716 --> 36:50.266
Come here to help to put up the tent.

36:50.596 --> 36:51.876
Coming.

36:53.506 --> 36:54.626
Just work.

36:54.946 --> 36:55.865
How to do it?

36:55.866 --> 36:56.505
Hold this.

36:56.506 --> 36:58.116
I'll plug the nail in.

36:58.546 --> 36:59.715
Hu.

36:59.716 --> 37:01.556
Why are you being lazy here again, Hu?

37:01.836 --> 37:02.905
Come here and work.

37:02.906 --> 37:04.436
He pretended not to hear us.

37:14.026 --> 37:15.385
Hu, you didn't work,

37:15.386 --> 37:16.715
and didn't help me with this.

37:16.716 --> 37:20.306
You can't ask an artist to work with his hands.

37:21.116 --> 37:22.196
Xiaxia.

37:22.346 --> 37:23.755
Don't do that.

37:23.756 --> 37:24.505
Come here.

37:24.506 --> 37:25.586
Drink coffee.

37:25.676 --> 37:28.076
We can always believe Huang.

37:28.546 --> 37:29.706
I'm not an artist.

37:31.946 --> 37:33.545
I'm improving your position,

37:33.546 --> 37:34.786
and you won't accept it.

37:39.156 --> 37:41.116
Let's pick some firewood.

37:42.236 --> 37:43.316
Let's pick more.

37:43.346 --> 37:44.786
It will be cold after sunset.

37:45.426 --> 37:46.506
Let's go.

37:49.986 --> 37:51.066
That way.

38:00.196 --> 38:01.786
Pick the thin sticks.

38:03.346 --> 38:03.676
Yes.

38:03.676 --> 38:04.756
Okay, this is good.

38:05.066 --> 38:07.476
How I wish to fall in love.

38:09.986 --> 38:11.275
Don't think too much.

38:11.276 --> 38:12.956
They can't be together.

38:13.196 --> 38:14.786
Why not?

38:15.346 --> 38:17.385
They are not married,

38:17.386 --> 38:19.306
and like each other.

38:21.236 --> 38:23.266
Hongdou's rent is over next month, right?

38:24.546 --> 38:26.635
You don't understand, little girl.

38:26.636 --> 38:29.826
With a time limitation,

38:30.116 --> 38:34.706
there is possible to be a short and strong love.

38:39.676 --> 38:41.025
You agree with him?

38:41.026 --> 38:42.106
Yes.

38:43.506 --> 38:45.436
I'm experienced.

38:48.986 --> 38:53.036
A girl would tell you,

38:53.506 --> 38:55.425
when you're singing to me,

38:55.426 --> 38:57.826
I have a special feeling.

38:58.506 --> 38:59.746
It's love.

39:00.066 --> 39:03.076
When I just started
to feel the fragrance of love,

39:03.386 --> 39:04.786
she sent me a message,

39:05.426 --> 39:06.506
and said,

39:07.156 --> 39:08.556
it's just a dream,

39:08.836 --> 39:10.076
just wake up.

39:10.676 --> 39:12.186
I asked why.

39:12.756 --> 39:13.836
Guess what?

39:14.346 --> 39:15.426
What?

39:15.986 --> 39:17.266
She blocked me.

39:19.796 --> 39:22.275
The light is good. I'll take a photo for you.

39:22.276 --> 39:25.826
Love comes and goes like a tornado.

39:27.116 --> 39:28.746
Although I agree with him,

39:29.386 --> 39:30.635
I think,

39:30.636 --> 39:33.115
Hongdou and Mr. Xie are rational people.

39:33.116 --> 39:35.065
If they can't be responsible in a relationship,

39:35.066 --> 39:36.755
they won't start.

39:36.756 --> 39:37.836
Reason,

39:38.236 --> 39:41.306
can prevent yourself
from entering a relationship,

39:41.836 --> 39:45.626
but it can't prevent yourself
from emerging in love.

39:55.796 --> 39:56.876
Nana,

39:57.196 --> 39:58.545
what do you think of the story

39:58.546 --> 40:00.985
that the president went on a tour,

40:00.986 --> 40:02.325
met the most handsome guy in the village,

40:02.326 --> 40:04.626
and helped him to start his business?

40:05.080 --> 40:08.156
♫ Don't know where to go ♫

40:10.156 --> 40:11.626
I have an image now.

40:14.196 --> 40:15.905
Write me in your story as well.

40:15.906 --> 40:16.986
No.

40:17.756 --> 40:19.236
Even the most minor character?

40:20.066 --> 40:21.146
No.

40:26.676 --> 40:27.235
Come on.

40:27.236 --> 40:28.316
Cheers.

40:29.466 --> 40:30.025
Come on.

40:30.026 --> 40:30.635
Cheers.

40:30.636 --> 40:31.345
Cheers.

40:31.346 --> 40:32.626
Cheers.

40:39.676 --> 40:40.985
This sweet potato is so delicious.

40:40.986 --> 40:41.945
So sweet.

40:41.946 --> 40:44.115
I felt all food is delicious recently.

40:44.116 --> 40:44.985
Me, too.

40:44.986 --> 40:47.186
I think the meals
Auntie Feng made are delicious.

40:47.836 --> 40:48.905
So,

40:48.906 --> 40:50.505
people should work more,

40:50.506 --> 40:52.036
and pay more effort.

40:52.796 --> 40:53.916
This potato,

40:54.506 --> 40:55.635
with spiced salt,

40:55.636 --> 40:56.876
is the most delicious.

40:58.346 --> 40:59.426
Enough.

41:05.756 --> 41:07.195
Drink less coffee,

41:07.196 --> 41:08.985
in case you can't fall asleep tonight.

41:08.986 --> 41:10.066
I won't sleep.

41:10.346 --> 41:12.266
I'll watch the stars for the whole night.

41:12.866 --> 41:14.346
Watch if you're not cold.

41:17.346 --> 41:18.426
How great.

41:18.836 --> 41:20.996
It's great for us to gather together.

41:22.236 --> 41:23.235
It's a pity.

41:23.236 --> 41:24.865
Mr. Ma is not here.

41:24.866 --> 41:26.396
If he is here,

41:26.636 --> 41:28.346
it would be better.

41:29.066 --> 41:30.146
Damai.

41:30.716 --> 41:31.956
When will you leave?

41:34.756 --> 41:36.626
Next week.

41:37.196 --> 41:39.956
I told Xiaochun I'll check out next week.

41:40.196 --> 41:42.116
Can you stay here for a few more days?

41:42.346 --> 41:43.835
I've been out for too long.

41:43.836 --> 41:46.876
My parents would often call
and ask me to go back.

41:47.946 --> 41:50.516
Have you told your dad you won't look for a job?

41:51.506 --> 41:52.905
And I promised my dad,

41:52.906 --> 41:54.786
I'll go out at least four days a week.

41:55.756 --> 41:56.836
That's it.

41:57.346 --> 41:58.426
Damai.

41:58.466 --> 42:00.345
Will you come back and visit us?

42:00.346 --> 42:01.345
Of course.

42:01.346 --> 42:03.465
I'll come back and live here
for a while next year.

42:03.466 --> 42:04.996
Will you be here?

42:05.636 --> 42:07.025
I don't know if they'll be here,

42:07.026 --> 42:07.905
but I'll be here.

42:07.906 --> 42:09.066
I have no place to go.

42:09.346 --> 42:10.673
Me, too.

42:10.674 --> 42:11.795
You have no place to go?

42:11.796 --> 42:13.275
That's great.

42:13.276 --> 42:14.755
I'll save a room for you,

42:14.756 --> 42:16.025
and give you some discount.

42:16.026 --> 42:16.675
No need.

42:16.676 --> 42:17.466
She can sleep with me,

42:17.467 --> 42:18.707
and doesn't need to pay.

42:19.196 --> 42:19.905
Mr. Xie.

42:19.906 --> 42:21.155
When we talk about this,

42:21.156 --> 42:23.876
you act like a mean merchant.

42:25.066 --> 42:26.275
Thank you for your praise.

42:26.276 --> 42:27.676
I'm a mean merchant,

42:27.677 --> 42:29.195
and you act like a mean merchant.

42:29.196 --> 42:32.545
I heard you only charged Mr. Ma 200 yuan

42:32.546 --> 42:34.226
for the love story in the tea shop?

42:34.986 --> 42:36.425
This is my principle.

42:36.426 --> 42:37.795
I can charge him a low price,

42:37.796 --> 42:38.956
but he must pay me.

42:39.466 --> 42:41.146
I really admire that.

42:45.386 --> 42:47.266
If Damai left,

42:47.676 --> 42:50.996
no one would make noodles
and share with me at midnight.

42:57.546 --> 42:58.345
My friend,

42:58.346 --> 42:59.635
don't be sad.

42:59.636 --> 43:01.614
It's like a dinner served when guests arrive.

43:01.638 --> 43:03.025
We'll leave after we finished eating,

43:03.026 --> 43:04.666
and we'll come again the next day.

43:05.756 --> 43:06.836
That's right.

43:08.836 --> 43:09.675
Hu.

43:09.676 --> 43:10.715
At this moment,

43:10.716 --> 43:13.076
I think you should sing a song.

43:13.346 --> 43:14.595
That's right.

43:14.596 --> 43:15.156
Okay.

43:15.157 --> 43:16.195
What do you want to listen to?

43:16.196 --> 43:17.155
I'm different from you.

43:17.156 --> 43:18.235
I won't charge.

43:18.236 --> 43:19.346
The Cost of Love?

43:20.156 --> 43:22.985
What's the song you sang in the room last night?

43:22.986 --> 43:24.066
It's good.

43:24.716 --> 43:26.345
That's my new song.

43:26.346 --> 43:27.426
Sing that.

43:30.676 --> 43:32.036
My new song,

43:32.346 --> 43:33.065
Wind,

43:33.066 --> 43:34.065
for all of you.

43:34.066 --> 43:35.146
Applaud!

43:37.026 --> 43:38.106
Okay, enough.

43:45.466 --> 43:47.865
♫ I've been longing, ♫

43:47.866 --> 43:49.786
♫ to realize my dream. ♫

43:51.026 --> 43:52.916
♫ The more you want it, ♫

43:53.196 --> 43:55.476
♫ the more clumsy you are. ♫

43:56.236 --> 43:58.595
♫ Your confusion, ♫

43:58.596 --> 44:00.746
♫ my panic, ♫

44:01.716 --> 44:05.116
♫ it is watching us, ♫

44:06.676 --> 44:08.826
♫ but it said nothing. ♫

44:09.116 --> 44:10.425
♫ Someone stops, ♫

44:10.426 --> 44:13.876
♫ and someone keeps going. ♫

44:14.836 --> 44:16.556
♫ Wandering. ♫

44:16.946 --> 44:19.396
♫ Life is the house, ♫

44:19.636 --> 44:22.065
♫ and days are the windows. ♫

44:22.066 --> 44:27.345
♫ The stories are happening around us. ♫

44:27.346 --> 44:29.626
♫ Every window. ♫

44:34.986 --> 44:36.786
♫ People, ♫

44:48.066 --> 44:50.516
♫ always forget. ♫

44:54.666 --> 45:00.136
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

45:02.106 --> 45:07.056
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

45:09.516 --> 45:15.566
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

45:15.886 --> 45:21.266
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

45:24.226 --> 45:29.616
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

45:31.596 --> 45:36.456
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

45:39.026 --> 45:45.226
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

45:45.556 --> 45:51.746
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

45:53.836 --> 46:00.275
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

46:00.276 --> 46:07.026
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

46:08.406 --> 46:10.455
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

46:10.456 --> 46:14.846
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

46:15.086 --> 46:22.316
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

46:27.096 --> 46:32.256
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

46:34.426 --> 46:39.786
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

46:41.816 --> 46:48.235
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

